            "detailed_description": "The game is about a mice living in a Kingdom far away where some citizens of the Kingdom stepped into a web of intrigue against the Queen. Once Noser and his aunt come to the Kingdom looking for a job. Noser's adventure starts from this moment.<br />\r\n\t<br />\r\n  <br />\r\nGameplay: <br />\r\n\tNoserland is a cartoon adventure-fighting game with a simple to learn interface for kids and not only for them. During passing levels of the game a player enjoys the third person view. Also, there is a help arrow that can be called at any moment of the game. As a result of that a player does not get lost  and this makes easy to discover the Noserland world.  Noser does not kill his opponents. When a mob loses a fight he just runs away. Also, when a player punishes the main boss a player gets an access to bonus levels. Also, during the game a player has the opportunity to collect game coins and spend them in the village shop.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures: <br />\r\n- no blood content<br />\r\n- no killing, only punishing<br />\r\n- classic fighting view <br />\r\n- simple interface<br />\r\n- additional levels with bosses",
